title: Aruba Central Radio
agents: aruba_central_aps
catalog: hw/network/wlan
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk
summary: Monitors each radio reported by an Aruba Central access point.
description:
 One itemized service is created per radio. It reports radio name, type, band,
 channel, status, spatial stream, radio MAC, transmit power, and utilization.

 Status values other than {Up} are {CRIT} by default. Radio utilization is
 checked against configurable upper thresholds, defaulting to 75 and 90
 percent. Transmit power and utilization are recorded as metrics when present.
item:
 A sanitized stable representation of {radio_name}, for example
 {Radio_5_GHz}.
discovery:
 One service is discovered for each radio in the AP piggyback document.
